{"elements":[{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"MOT-001","label":"p99 checkout latency tripled after v4.7.0","node_type":"motivation","shape":"diamond","color":"#7C6F64","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.852100Z","description":"Checkout p99 moved from 182ms to 613ms within 8 minutes of the v4.7.0 rollout. The 99th-percentile SLO (250ms) is burning 14x budget; at the current rate the monthly error budget is gone in under two days. Roll-back is available but the release contains a compliance fix that cannot be reverted, so the regression has to be understood and patched forward.","source":"incident/INC-2471.md"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"FACT-001","label":"Deploy + alert timeline","node_type":"facts","shape":"ellipse","color":"#83A598","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.855371Z","fact_text":"v4.7.0 reached 100% of the fleet at 09:14:03 UTC. Latency alert fired 09:21:47 UTC. No infrastructure change, node-pool rotation or database failover is recorded in the 72h window; RDS CPU held at 31-34% throughout.","source":"observability/deploy-timeline#2026-08-19"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"CLM-001","label":"Triage: regression is deploy-correlated","node_type":"claim","shape":"star","color":"#4A6FE3","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.858220Z","claim_text":"The latency regression was introduced by the v4.7.0 application deploy rather than by an infrastructure or database change, based on the 7-minute gap between rollout completion and the alert.","confidence":0.35,"evidence_ids":["FACT-001"],"credibility_score":0.149,"score_details":{"evidence_coverage":0.4,"reproducibility":0.0,"data_provenance":0.0,"statistical_validity":0.3,"pipeline_integrity":0.0},"score_details_full":{"evidence_coverage":{"value":0.4,"label":"Evidence Coverage","weight":0.3,"reasons":["no upstream experiment_design, hypothesis, result, rq, run node(s)","all 1 declared evidence id(s) are linked"],"cited_nodes":["FACT-001"],"remedy":"add the missing upstream node type(s): experiment_design, hypothesis, result, rq, run"},"reproducibility":{"value":0.0,"label":"Reproducibility","weight":0.2,"reasons":["no RUN node is upstream of this claim, so nothing can be re-executed"],"cited_nodes":[],"remedy":"record the execution as a RUN node and link it into this claim's chain"},"data_provenance":{"value":0.0,"label":"Data Provenance","weight":0.15,"reasons":["no ARTIFACT node is upstream — the data and code behind this claim are not tracked"],"cited_nodes":[],"remedy":"add the dataset/script as an ARTIFACT node linked into the chain"},"statistical_validity":{"value":0.3,"label":"Statistical Validity","weight":0.2,"reasons":["claim quantifies its confidence (0.35)","no RESULT node upstream, so there are no numbers to check"],"cited_nodes":[],"remedy":"attach the measured RESULT that this claim rests on"},"pipeline_integrity":{"value":0.0,"label":"Pipeline Integrity","weight":0.15,"reasons":["0/7 chain links present: none","broken links: motivation, rq, hypothesis, experiment_design, artifact, run, result"],"cited_nodes":[],"remedy":"complete the lineage by adding: motivation, rq, hypothesis, experiment_design, artifact, run, result"}}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RQ-001","label":"RQ1: Which v4.7.0 change accounts for the added p99?","node_type":"rq","shape":"round-rectangle","color":"#458588","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.863770Z","description":"v4.7.0 contains 23 commits across the cart serializer, the pricing engine and the telemetry middleware.","scope":"checkout-api request path only; payment gateway excluded."}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RQ-002","label":"RQ2: Fixed per-request overhead, or load-dependent?","node_type":"rq","shape":"round-rectangle","color":"#458588","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.866426Z","description":"A constant per-request cost points at serialization; a cost that grows with concurrency points at pool or lock contention.","scope":"150 / 300 / 450 RPS replay arms."}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RQ-003","label":"RQ3: Does the patch restore p99 without changing totals?","node_type":"rq","shape":"round-rectangle","color":"#458588","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.868969Z","description":"Any fix in the pricing path must be proven output-identical before it can ship to checkout.","scope":"Canary + differential replay of settled orders."}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"HYP-001","label":"H1: GC pressure from the new JSON serializer","node_type":"hypothesis","shape":"triangle","color":"#B16286","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.882921Z","description":"v4.7.0 replaced the hand-rolled cart encoder with a generic dataclass serializer that allocates a dict per line item.","null_hypothesis":"GC pause time accounts for less than 10% of the added p99."}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"HYP-002","label":"H2: N+1 queries from PricingRule eager-load","node_type":"hypothesis","shape":"triangle","color":"#B16286","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.885414Z","description":"The new cart serializer touches `item.pricing_rule` inside the render loop; the relationship is lazy, so each line item may trigger its own SELECT.","null_hypothesis":"Queries per cart render are unchanged from v4.6.3."}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"HYP-003","label":"H3: The candidate patch restores p99 and is output-safe","node_type":"hypothesis","shape":"triangle","color":"#B16286","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.888589Z","description":"Batch-load PricingRule with a single selectinload and cache it per request; totals must be byte-identical.","null_hypothesis":"Patched p99 is no better than v4.7.0, or order totals differ."}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"EXP-001","label":"Load-replay bisect with profiler + query tap","node_type":"experiment_design","shape":"rectangle","color":"#689D6A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.901858Z","description":"Replay a captured peak-hour hour of production traffic against v4.6.3 and v4.7.0 in an isolated staging fleet, alternating arm order across repetitions to cancel warm-up drift.","methodology":"5 repetitions x 15 min per arm at 450 RPS (plus 150/300 RPS sweeps); py-spy sampling at 99Hz; gc + tracemalloc counters; pg_stat_statements diffed per arm; Mann-Whitney U on the per-request latency vectors.","parameters":{"target_rps":450,"arm_minutes":15,"repetitions":5,"profiler_hz":99,"warmup_minutes":3,"seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"EXP-002","label":"Canary + differential replay of the patch","node_type":"experiment_design","shape":"rectangle","color":"#689D6A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.911214Z","description":"Ship v4.7.1-rc2 to a 10% canary for 45 minutes, then replay 12,000 settled orders through patched and unpatched builds and diff every computed total.","methodology":"Canary vs control p99 compared over matched traffic; bootstrap CI (10k resamples) on the p99 difference; differential replay asserts exact equality of order_total, tax_total and discount_total.","parameters":{"canary_pct":10,"canary_minutes":45,"orders_replayed":12000,"bootstrap_resamples":10000,"seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"ART-001","label":"checkout-api @ v4.6.3 (baseline build)","node_type":"artifact","shape":"hexagon","color":"#D79921","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.916532Z","artifact_type":"code","path":"services/checkout-api","version":"4.6.3"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"ART-002","label":"checkout-api @ v4.7.0 (regressed build)","node_type":"artifact","shape":"hexagon","color":"#D79921","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.919002Z","artifact_type":"code","path":"services/checkout-api","version":"4.7.0"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"ART-003","label":"peak-hour traffic replay corpus","node_type":"artifact","shape":"hexagon","color":"#D79921","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.923389Z","artifact_type":"data","path":"data/replay/2026-08-19T08-09Z-peak.parquet","version":"2026-08-19"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"ART-004","label":"replay_runner.py (load harness)","node_type":"artifact","shape":"hexagon","color":"#D79921","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.929968Z","artifact_type":"code","path":"tools/loadgen/replay_runner.py","version":"0.9.2"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"ART-005","label":"pg_query_tap.py (per-request query counter)","node_type":"artifact","shape":"hexagon","color":"#D79921","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.935499Z","artifact_type":"code","path":"tools/obs/pg_query_tap.py","version":"0.4.0"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RUN-001","label":"replay v4.6.3 baseline arm","node_type":"run","shape":"ellipse","color":"#98971A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.957197Z","status":"completed","git_commit":"9f2c41a","duration_seconds":1806.4,"environment":{"python":"3.12.4","postgres":"16.3","sqlalchemy":"2.0.31","pods":12,"cpu_per_pod":"2000m","seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RUN-002","label":"replay v4.7.0 arm with py-spy","node_type":"run","shape":"ellipse","color":"#98971A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.967464Z","status":"completed","git_commit":"c78be05","duration_seconds":1812.9,"environment":{"python":"3.12.4","postgres":"16.3","sqlalchemy":"2.0.31","pods":12,"cpu_per_pod":"2000m","py_spy":"0.3.14","seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RES-001","label":"Baseline latency profile (v4.6.3)","node_type":"result","shape":"barrel","color":"#076678","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.978885Z","result_file":"results/replay_v4.6.3.json","metrics":{"p50_ms":41.2,"p95_ms":118.6,"p99_ms":182.4,"achieved_rps":451.8,"error_rate":0.0004},"statistical_info":{"samples":406620,"repetitions":5,"p99_ci95_ms":[178.1,186.9],"method":"hdr-histogram"}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RES-002","label":"Regressed latency profile (v4.7.0) + CPU attribution","node_type":"result","shape":"barrel","color":"#076678","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.984085Z","result_file":"results/replay_v4.7.0.json","metrics":{"p50_ms":63.7,"p95_ms":288.1,"p99_ms":613.2,"delta_p99_ms":430.8,"cpu_share_serializer":0.09,"cpu_share_db_wait":0.71,"achieved_rps":449.1},"statistical_info":{"test":"mann-whitney-u","p_value":8e-05,"effect_size_cliffs_delta":0.71,"delta_p99_ci95_ms":[402.6,458.3],"repetitions":5}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RUN-003","label":"gc + tracemalloc instrumentation run","node_type":"run","shape":"ellipse","color":"#98971A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.989644Z","status":"completed","git_commit":"c78be05","duration_seconds":912.7,"environment":{"python":"3.12.4","gc_debug":"STATS","tracemalloc_depth":12,"pods":4,"seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RES-003","label":"GC / allocation accounting","node_type":"result","shape":"barrel","color":"#076678","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:34.997945Z","result_file":"results/gc_accounting_v4.7.0.json","metrics":{"gc_pause_p99_ms":3.6,"gc_pause_share_of_p99":0.006,"alloc_mb_per_request":1.42,"alloc_delta_vs_baseline_mb":0.31,"gen2_collections_per_min":4.0},"statistical_info":{"test":"mann-whitney-u","p_value":0.31,"conclusion":"no significant GC pause difference vs v4.6.3","samples":203310}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"CLM-002","label":"H1 falsified: GC pressure is not the driver","node_type":"claim","shape":"star","color":"#4A6FE3","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.003665Z","claim_text":"Garbage collection accounts for 3.6ms of the 613ms p99 (0.6%), and GC pause time does not differ significantly between v4.6.3 and v4.7.0 (p=0.31). The 431ms regression is not explained by allocation pressure from the new serializer. Held provisionally: the instrumentation run covers a single 15-minute window at one traffic shape, and gen-2 behaviour under sustained load has not been observed.","confidence":0.48,"evidence_ids":["RES-002","RES-003"],"credibility_score":0.48,"score_details":{"evidence_coverage":1.0,"reproducibility":1.0,"data_provenance":1.0,"statistical_validity":1.0,"pipeline_integrity":1.0},"score_details_full":{"evidence_coverage":{"value":1.0,"label":"Evidence Coverage","weight":0.3,"reasons":["all five expected upstream node types are present","all 2 declared evidence id(s) are linked"],"cited_nodes":["RES-002","RES-003"],"remedy":""},"reproducibility":{"value":1.0,"label":"Reproducibility","weight":0.2,"reasons":["RUN-002 records commit, environment and duration","RUN-003 records commit, environment and duration"],"cited_nodes":["RUN-002","RUN-003"],"remedy":""},"data_provenance":{"value":1.0,"label":"Data Provenance","weight":0.15,"reasons":["ART-002 records path, version and type","ART-003 records path, version and type","ART-004 records path, version and type"],"cited_nodes":["ART-002","ART-003","ART-004"],"remedy":""},"statistical_validity":{"value":1.0,"label":"Statistical Validity","weight":0.2,"reasons":["claim quantifies its confidence (0.48)","2/2 result(s) carry metrics","2 result(s) carry statistical_info (p-value / CI / effect size)"],"cited_nodes":["RES-002","RES-003"],"remedy":""},"pipeline_integrity":{"value":1.0,"label":"Pipeline Integrity","weight":0.15,"reasons":["7/7 chain links present: motivation, rq, hypothesis, experiment_design, artifact, run, result"],"cited_nodes":[],"remedy":""}}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RUN-004","label":"query tap on the v4.7.0 arm","node_type":"run","shape":"ellipse","color":"#98971A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.011969Z","status":"completed","git_commit":"c78be05","duration_seconds":1804.2,"environment":{"python":"3.12.4","postgres":"16.3","sqlalchemy":"2.0.31","pg_stat_statements":"enabled","pods":12,"seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RES-004","label":"Queries per cart render: 1.9 -> 43.6","node_type":"result","shape":"barrel","color":"#076678","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.022747Z","result_file":"results/query_tap_v4.7.0.json","metrics":{"queries_per_render_baseline":1.9,"queries_per_render_v470":43.6,"pricing_rule_selects_per_render":41.7,"median_line_items_per_cart":41.0,"db_wait_ms_p99":437.5,"db_wait_share_of_delta":0.94},"statistical_info":{"correlation_items_vs_latency_r":0.93,"p_value":2e-06,"n_requests":402880,"note":"one SELECT per line item, linear in cart size"}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"CLM-003","label":"Root cause: PricingRule eager-load fires 43.6 queries per render","node_type":"claim","shape":"star","color":"#4A6FE3","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.028004Z","claim_text":"cart/serializers.py:118 in v4.7.0 dereferences `item.pricing_rule` inside the line-item loop. The relationship is lazy, so a median 41-item cart issues 41.7 extra SELECTs, raising per-request database wait to 437.5ms p99 -- 94% of the 431ms regression, and linear in cart size (r=0.93, p<1e-5). This, not serialization cost or GC, is the regression.","confidence":0.86,"evidence_ids":["RES-001","RES-002","RES-004"],"credibility_score":0.86,"score_details":{"evidence_coverage":1.0,"reproducibility":1.0,"data_provenance":1.0,"statistical_validity":1.0,"pipeline_integrity":1.0},"score_details_full":{"evidence_coverage":{"value":1.0,"label":"Evidence Coverage","weight":0.3,"reasons":["all five expected upstream node types are present","all 3 declared evidence id(s) are linked"],"cited_nodes":["RES-001","RES-002","RES-004"],"remedy":""},"reproducibility":{"value":1.0,"label":"Reproducibility","weight":0.2,"reasons":["RUN-001 records commit, environment and duration","RUN-002 records commit, environment and duration","RUN-004 records commit, environment and duration"],"cited_nodes":["RUN-001","RUN-002","RUN-004"],"remedy":""},"data_provenance":{"value":1.0,"label":"Data Provenance","weight":0.15,"reasons":["ART-001 records path, version and type","ART-002 records path, version and type","ART-003 records path, version and type","ART-004 records path, version and type","ART-005 records path, version and type"],"cited_nodes":["ART-001","ART-002","ART-003","ART-004","ART-005"],"remedy":""},"statistical_validity":{"value":1.0,"label":"Statistical Validity","weight":0.2,"reasons":["claim quantifies its confidence (0.86)","3/3 result(s) carry metrics","3 result(s) carry statistical_info (p-value / CI / effect size)"],"cited_nodes":["RES-001","RES-002","RES-004"],"remedy":""},"pipeline_integrity":{"value":1.0,"label":"Pipeline Integrity","weight":0.15,"reasons":["7/7 chain links present: motivation, rq, hypothesis, experiment_design, artifact, run, result"],"cited_nodes":[],"remedy":""}}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"ART-006","label":"checkout-api @ v4.7.1-rc2 (selectinload patch)","node_type":"artifact","shape":"hexagon","color":"#D79921","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.039139Z","artifact_type":"code","path":"services/checkout-api","version":"4.7.1-rc2"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"ART-007","label":"differential replay fixtures (12k settled orders)","node_type":"artifact","shape":"hexagon","color":"#D79921","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.041741Z","artifact_type":"data","path":"data/fixtures/settled_orders_12k.jsonl","version":"2026-08-19"}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RUN-005","label":"10% canary of v4.7.1-rc2","node_type":"run","shape":"ellipse","color":"#98971A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.055521Z","status":"completed","git_commit":"4ad9e77","duration_seconds":2702.5,"environment":{"python":"3.12.4","postgres":"16.3","sqlalchemy":"2.0.31","canary_pct":10,"pods":12,"seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RES-005","label":"Canary latency: p99 back to 176ms","node_type":"result","shape":"barrel","color":"#076678","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.067658Z","result_file":"results/canary_v4.7.1-rc2.json","metrics":{"p50_ms":39.8,"p95_ms":114.2,"p99_ms":176.3,"delta_vs_baseline_ms":-6.1,"queries_per_render":2.1,"error_rate":0.0003},"statistical_info":{"method":"bootstrap","resamples":10000,"delta_p99_ci95_ms":[-14.7,2.4],"p_value":0.41,"interpretation":"indistinguishable from the v4.6.3 baseline"}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RUN-006","label":"differential replay, patched vs unpatched","node_type":"run","shape":"ellipse","color":"#98971A","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.077640Z","status":"completed","git_commit":"4ad9e77","duration_seconds":438.1,"environment":{"python":"3.12.4","postgres":"16.3","mode":"offline-replay","seed":20260819}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"RES-006","label":"Differential replay: 12,000 orders, 0 mismatches","node_type":"result","shape":"barrel","color":"#076678","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.085216Z","result_file":"results/diff_replay_12k.json","metrics":{"orders_compared":12000.0,"order_total_mismatches":0.0,"tax_total_mismatches":0.0,"discount_total_mismatches":0.0,"max_abs_cent_delta":0.0},"statistical_info":{"coverage":"12000/12000 settled orders in the 24h window","rule_paths_exercised":47,"binomial_upper_bound_95pct_mismatch_rate":0.00025}}},{"group":"nodes","data":{"id":"CLM-004","label":"RESOLVED: v4.7.1-rc2 restores p99 with identical totals","node_type":"claim","shape":"star","color":"#4A6FE3","unknown_type":false,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:05:35.092024Z","claim_text":"Batching PricingRule with a single selectinload returns queries per cart render to 2.1 and p99 to 176.3ms -- statistically indistinguishable from the pre-regression baseline of 182.4ms (bootstrap 95% CI [-14.7, +2.4]ms). A differential replay of all 12,000 settled orders from the incident window produced zero differences in order, tax or discount totals across 47 pricing rule paths. The regression is resolved and the fix is output-safe to ship.","confidence":0.91,"